                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Wacky Spores is a fun, casual RPG strategy that brings a challenge each time you play. The turn-based combat is fun, and the manual aiming adds layers of strategic depth. The leveling system can feel like a grind, especially early on. Keep doing those quests, and take out thiefs & crates - I've found that's the fastest way to gather coins and gain levels. Overall, Wacky Spores is a bunch of fun once you get some unlockables and can start to dish out some pain. :)\n\nMore detailed (but still quick) video review: https://youtu.be/RTujPBdX4Hs",
